   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Our investment, a $52 million credit facility, will support DBL Group to establish Jinnat Textile Mills Ltd, a greenfield, cotton yarn spinning mill, which will be housed in a LEED certified green building. The construction of Jinnat Textile will support Bangladesh&#xED;s economic growth by creating jobs for mostly low-skilled workers, of which 50 per cent will be women.</narrative>
   </description>
